Dialogue: 3,0:21:51.24,0:21:56.10,ED-CN,,0,30,20,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\shad0\blur6\bord0.2\3c&H000000&\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&}他如洪水向我袭来
